fighters.plan:
# Dancer: stick, move and never stand still
5H/4/11 (ring)
if round <= 3 then 4H/3/13 (ring)
if opponent = exhausted then 7H/7/6
if score < 0 and round >= 7 then 6H/5/9 (ring)
if score > 2*(1 + 12 - round) then 2/2/16 (ring)
if endurance_percent < 45 then 4/3/13 (ring)

# Counterpuncher: make him miss, make him pay
6/6/8 (counter)
if score < 1 then 7/6/7 (counter)
if opponent <= tired then 6H/6/8 (counter)
if score + 12 - round < 0 and endurance_percent >= 40 then 7/7/6
if score > 2*(1 + 12 - round) then 2/2/16
if endurance_percent < 45 then 4/4/12 (counter)

# Clincher: tie him up and drown him late
5B/5/10 (clinch)
if opponent <= tired then 7B/6/7 (inside)
if opponent = exhausted then 7H/8/5 (inside)
if score + 12 - round < 0 and endurance_percent >= 40 then 8/7/5 (inside)
if score > 2*(1 + 12 - round) then 2/2/16 (clinch)
if endurance_percent < 40 then 3/3/14 (clinch)

